; pio-square.pio -- the PIO program of "A square wave from PIO with side-set" (pio-square.s).
; Copyright (c) 2026 Sajid Muhaimin Choudhury. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
; Rights class: content (a MAVILERA template, written for the application).
;
; Build assembles this file with pio-square.s: its two words are at square_program; square_wrap and
; square_wrap_target are its wrap. Each nop does nothing; its side-set drives the pin.

.program square
.side_set 1
.wrap_target
    nop side 1 [15]         ; high: 16 cycles
    nop side 0 [15]         ; low: 16 cycles
.wrap
